WEBVTT

00:07:27.913 --> 00:07:31.996
And the complete disregard

00:07:32.038 --> 00:07:36.454
that it showed society
having of Black life.

00:07:37.954 --> 00:07:41.913
We in the Black community
have always had value.

00:07:42.496 --> 00:07:47.079
It's just been hidden from view,
not well documented.

00:07:47.746 --> 00:07:49.663
Over 20 years ago,

00:07:49.704 --> 00:07:51.663
I sat at my dining room table.

00:07:52.079 --> 00:07:54.746
I was unemployed,

00:07:54.788 --> 00:07:57.288
no kids and single.

00:07:57.913 --> 00:08:01.871
And you get to the point in your life
when you start asking: